%% UI owners: packages/message/src/lib/components/message-content/message-announcement-content/message-announcement-content.component.ts:1；packages/message/src/lib/services/message.service.ts:1；src/app/message-host/runtime/im-gate/helix/helixTauriImGate.service.ts:1（实际命令与关联回灌）
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员点公告上的「确认收到」，按钮转为已确认态；发布者能看到谁确认了、谁还没确认。
  Note over UI,Web: 合同登记快照（不等于当前实现或实测）：mock=missing；helix=partial；dual=yes；personaLocal=yes；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: postRead + getPostReaders(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_post_read + im_post_read_list", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_post_read + im_post_read_list", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_post_read + im_post_read_list", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 公告已读确认 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http 复用 Phase 1 post read/readers 路由，不新增公告专属端点
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  Go-->>WS: WS authority event or canonical result
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(authority bytes)
  E->>IM: apply authoritative event before settlement
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction announcement version + list + channel cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（im:post:read，im:post:readers）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ 原始事件 → adapter 映射 kind → Angular 消费
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：成员点击「确认收到」只提交 postRead 意图；Go 按 snapshotId 幂等更新消息已读权威，Helix 投影绝对 readUserIds/unreadUserIds 与计数，重复点击或重复事件不得改变集合大小；Angular 以 readUserIds/unreadUserIds 为唯一确认与未确认名单，再通过现有 Ucenter 能力补全用户名、头像和部门；资料缺失时保留 userId 占位，不得从名单中删除该用户
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：断供必须写红灯用例：不得把 status:'SUCCESS' 断言为「确认已落地」—— 现状确认不落地、刷新即丢，用例必须显式证明 queryAnnouncements 前后无差异；不得新增公告专属确认表、确认名单、readBits 或 /post/announcement/read 作为目标权威；必须复用 Phase 1 postRead/postReaders
  Note over E,Sink: 原始事件名（按触发分支）：im:post:read，im:post:readers；客户端 kind/action 由 adapter 映射，不是原始 Emit 名称
